menu "ESP Base"

    config ESP_BASE_TEST_NO_BROKER
        bool "Test build only: never connect to the MQTT broker"
        default n
        help
            The firmware joins Wi-Fi but never connects to the broker, so it is never
            confirmed and the bootloader rolls back after the 300 s window. Used only to
            verify automatic rollback; release packaging refuses images built with it.

endmenu
